  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "陪你向前行"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<iframe frameborder=\"0\" height=\"700\" marginheight=\"0\" marginwidth=\"0\" src=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vQVpMUSGBkiNSYCxXSG2EFXKhIZZCfOjkXFh-2bIuJu-_Q1kPl12654JOnxaLo4VLsrODNGYzzJ58JI/pub?embedded=true\" width=\"700\"></iframe>\n\n\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b></b></span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgu09nNVKFo4IzmwyfjV2oRLPNRhQNc7wNsVEVivu4RxTPX6Oi0_2rhfIr2yqWcX8vnS168nF0XoY0ufObLjRl-eT3t6CDs-awNnmSSfqB9UuhSFlIRL9M9V-PdsmUtnSLzxrT6NOQzYvCEjQ45zRHkeZypujmhaxXMEqBSurDVtgaI3h-PjUZ23M7B1A/s657/%E9%98%BFK%E8%B3%9E%E5%BE%BD%E7%AB%A0_%E9%BB%83%E9%87%91.jpg\" style=\"clear: left; float: left; margin-bottom: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"657\" data-original-width=\"457\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgu09nNVKFo4IzmwyfjV2oRLPNRhQNc7wNsVEVivu4RxTPX6Oi0_2rhfIr2yqWcX8vnS168nF0XoY0ufObLjRl-eT3t6CDs-awNnmSSfqB9UuhSFlIRL9M9V-PdsmUtnSLzxrT6NOQzYvCEjQ45zRHkeZypujmhaxXMEqBSurDVtgaI3h-PjUZ23M7B1A/s320/%E9%98%BFK%E8%B3%9E%E5%BE%BD%E7%AB%A0_%E9%BB%83%E9%87%91.jpg\" width=\"223\" /></a></b></span></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>作者：</b></span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>翁月鳳</b></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Kap平常時仝款，來lín兜只是開講，tng當我問你冊讀了按怎ê時，lín老母像leh講笑話：「In阿姆講伊lóng是leh考港號。」Lín阿叔順話尾：「Kā hia-ê成績ê數字簽--落就tio̍h--ah--lah，牌支a̍h tio̍h koh想？」考試紙頂面，hia-ê無超過60 ê分數，tsit个時tsūn，像一群白目囡仔，一組一組跳--出-來，tī大人ê笑聲內面，nih目吐舌變虎貓。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">想bē到，你ê分數suah變做逐家ê話柄kap笑詼。阿嬸笑bē出--來，kan-na感覺心leh tshū流籠，心情淡薄仔罩烏陰。Tī你ê ǹg望，一定有真濟擺，日頭用無仝款ê光線做信號，beh報你行另外一條景色khah suí ê路，只是，你lóng激外外。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span></span></p><a name='more'></a><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">就因為án-ne，我推薦家己beh做你ê家庭教師，雖然我冊讀無濟，m̄-koh為著beh hōo你ê爸母信任，我kā家己ê gâu膨風--ah。Suà--落，就是鼓勵你認真讀冊，你配合ê意願也真kuân，你kám知影？阿嬸歡喜kah bē輸去允著一个天下間上好ê頭路，mā好親像已經看著你美好ê未來--ah。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">去書局kā你揣參考冊ê時，ke買一本《西遊記》，因為阿嬸冊讀無濟，suah是想beh借別項閒冊，kā你愛拍電動ê心，沓沓仔khiú--tńg-來。逐工，我lóng面皮激厚厚去lín兜，因為lín老母tshiâng-tsāi講：「牛頭班哪有要緊？後過bē變歹就好--ah，你來教mā是白教，伊bē認真讀--ê--lah。M̄免tshap--伊，據在--伊。」我無同意tsia-ê話，kan-na記tiâu你kā阿嬸講--過，將來你想beh做老師，就憑你tsit句話，我就啥mi̍h lóng m̄驚，想beh招你向前行！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Tī時有考試？數學教到佗位？Tse是阿嬸上tsia̍p問--你ê話。Lán做伙奮鬥ê頭擺考試是考地理，我問你考了啥款？Uì你ê表情就知影，你累積ê拍拚，已經去換著歡喜--ah。你笑微微kā我講：「我讀ê hia lóng有考--出-來neh！阿嬸，你今仔日beh教我啥？」你是m̄是已經感受--著，進步hōo你ê日子充滿期待kap快樂，親像是夢自由leh行徙？</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">來，lán koh繼續堅持--落-去，hōo昨hng ê放蕩kap恥笑，永遠jiok你bē tio̍h！&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span></span></p><!--more--><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjxn5AXX602Z4I7LvuWIKHqLHZc6tPQbCdjUQbx5DFv-IDTRZk9R3DGfHAZSfISsnRykZL70VzVh3ZkNhef_AQPtrumLJihgKcS2zT6RXinL4hMqnRmTMzY7eBDVmIW2i_DMOig97YkMIKkraqdL5gva9dJwdEzi199jwVLGEw0x1hK72qCTCGxZv7eYA/s4032/%E7%BF%81%E6%9C%88%E9%B3%B3.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3024\" data-original-width=\"4032\" height=\"480\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjxn5AXX602Z4I7LvuWIKHqLHZc6tPQbCdjUQbx5DFv-IDTRZk9R3DGfHAZSfISsnRykZL70VzVh3ZkNhef_AQPtrumLJihgKcS2zT6RXinL4hMqnRmTMzY7eBDVmIW2i_DMOig97YkMIKkraqdL5gva9dJwdEzi199jwVLGEw0x1hK72qCTCGxZv7eYA/w640-h480/%E7%BF%81%E6%9C%88%E9%B3%B3.jpg\" width=\"640\" /></a></td></tr><tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=\"text-align: center;\">正手爿--ê是作者翁月鳳</td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg_vgYrk4hW-sy8lf_5007WQ2siEEHHQ-foS1E7yvfJKkirMC65Z5fzUrVV8MZeP7zzCt4Z9HTCRAvUNg9b8YhdCrfb-DQtLigzgbskNb4RX-s2gWOWqG8Lsg3ZlnKrEgXgXlwx5ec7HJujVca-CSxF1tpZ-JdSCgYyVhWG-vtyNpFz9FIdFS_qIemDTg/s1424/336%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg_vgYrk4hW-sy8lf_5007WQ2siEEHHQ-foS1E7yvfJKkirMC65Z5fzUrVV8MZeP7zzCt4Z9HTCRAvUNg9b8YhdCrfb-DQtLigzgbskNb4RX-s2gWOWqG8Lsg3ZlnKrEgXgXlwx5ec7HJujVca-CSxF1tpZ-JdSCgYyVhWG-vtyNpFz9FIdFS_qIemDTg/w450-h640/336%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhhANF7MTwpbLDMhlc6pCaAjvd_Eg5KqZJozDRpUCmC6p8Eys0BFVhQvb